Server init.

>> x := Blob nua: 65 cineál: ['char'].
# for this test you need set a path to libc (puts)
>> libname := Ríomhchlár socrú: ['FFITESTLIB'].
Server nasc: (
 Liosta nua ;
 libname ;
 ['putchar'] ;
 ( Liosta nua ; ['char'] ) ;
 ['void'] ;
 ['Print'] ;
 ['char:']
).
Print char: (x ó: 0 fad: 1), líne-nua.
x saor.

